# Normalise every text file to LF in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Tests in this repository read their own source files and compare byte offsets
# (the security audit locates the one permitted `http://` string by position). A
# CRLF checkout makes those offsets drift, so the guarantee has to be enforced by
# the repository rather than assumed from each contributor's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched by the normaliser.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
